{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act51side_level_act51side_02_end",
  "groupId": "act51side",
  "stageId": "act51side_02",
  "title": "枷锁之中",
  "storyCode": "PA-2",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act51side/level_act51side_02_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "3d47579e3b5ca2323e7b0436def5931989e7df39f8a9770cb3367be5f668536e",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯警察",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "所有人！立刻停止反抗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯警察",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你们今晚在这里的行动是绝对不被允许的，希望你们认识到自己的错误！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯警察",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我们不想伤害你们这些年轻人，也希望你们配合我们——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯警察",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "*激烈的乌萨斯粗口*！你还敢打我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯警察",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他妈的，真是不要脸的畜生，简直不可理喻！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯警察",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2170_1",
      "text": "报告！我们已经完全控制了舞会厅周围的街道，所有能抓住的人都在这了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警察厅厅长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1981_1",
      "text": "疯了......这世道真是疯了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警察厅厅长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1981_1",
      "text": "学生不在学校，集团军不在自己的属地......整个乌萨斯难道就没有一个人待在他应该在的地方吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯警察",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2170_1",
      "text": "呃，那您看是不是先把这些人带回去，再慢慢审问......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警察厅厅长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1981_1",
      "text": "你难道真不认识这些学生的校服？这几所学校里能有多少平民？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警察厅厅长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1981_1",
      "text": "你是打算把这些大人物的公子千金带回警察厅，然后等着那些公爵大人挨个上门要人吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯警察",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2170_1",
      "text": "这......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯警察",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2170_1",
      "text": "难道......要把他们原地放了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警察厅厅长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1981_1",
      "text": "动动你的脑子！这里面说不定还混着在舞会行刺的歹徒，说放就放，议会来要人的时候我送你去顶罪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯警察",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2170_1",
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警察厅厅长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1981_1",
      "text": "陛下在上......明明只要熬过今年最后一年，我就能参选议员，离开这个该死的警察厅！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警察厅厅长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1981_1",
      "text": "为什么偏要在这个时候！该死......该死！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警察厅厅长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1981_1",
      "text": "......我们的监狱还关得下多少人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯警察",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2170_1",
      "text": "哦，把那些马上要掉脑袋的人都清出去，就可以装下——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警察厅厅长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1981_1",
      "text": "......再好好想想吧，我们的监狱真的装得下这么多人吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯警察",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2170_1",
      "text": "呃......也许是，装不下的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警察厅厅长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1981_1",
      "text": "当然，当然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警察厅厅长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1981_1",
      "text": "不过我知道一个地方，可以关得下这些无法无天的年轻疯子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴普洛维奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2158_1",
      "text": "陛下在上......有没有人能告诉我，为什么我一回到这片垃圾场，就看到十几辆装满了人的载具。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "被雇佣的打手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2166_1",
      "text": "哦，刚才警察厅来人了。他们说牢房不够用了，要征用卡托加区的地盘收容一下这些大闹舞会的犯人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "被雇佣的打手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2166_1",
      "text": "真好笑，我还从来没见过那些条子说话这样客气。对了，他们还给你留了封信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "被雇佣的打手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2166_1",
      "text": "“尊敬的”......“卡托加区”......“没有用的东西”......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴普洛维奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2158_1",
      "text": "把信给我，我自己看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴普洛维奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2158_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴普洛维奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2158_1",
      "text": "“没有用的东西”，这怎么会是没有用的东西？那个愚蠢的厅长害怕麻烦，就没有想过这是多么难得的机会？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴普洛维奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2158_1",
      "text": "把格罗莫夫叫过来，明天开始我需要频繁访问一些重要的大人物，管控这里的任务要交给他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "被雇佣的打手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2166_1",
      "text": "头儿昨晚喝醉了，现在还没醒呢——后街那家酒吧用的酒精一定有问题！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴普洛维奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2158_1",
      "text": "该死的......我请你们来维护治安可是花了大价钱的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴普洛维奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2158_1",
      "text": "现在就去把他给我泼醒，告诉他，让他招待好我们这些客人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴普洛维奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2158_1",
      "text": "从现在开始，连只鼷兽都不许从卡托加区放出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "被雇佣的打手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2166_1",
      "text": "是要我们“好好招待”一下这些客人的意思？要注意留活口吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴普洛维奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2158_1",
      "text": "可怜的“小松针”，我知道凭你可怜的智慧是听不懂太复杂的指令的，所以我已经用了尽可能简单的语言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴普洛维奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2158_1",
      "text": "收起你们的那些坏习惯，不许对这些人动手动脚......明白我指的“这些人”都是谁吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "被雇佣的打手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2166_1",
      "text": "嘁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴普洛维奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2158_1",
      "text": "听好了，如果没有忘记是谁给你们的钱，让你们还能去脏酒馆里浪费生命......就记住我说的话！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴普洛维奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2158_1",
      "text": "他们的命，天生比你们贵重！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌克西克",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呼......呼......应该差不多要到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌克西克",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "很好......一路上都没遇到什么人，应该没有警卫......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唔......有人在我后面吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌克西克",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你吓了我一跳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌克西克",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你是谁？为什么会在能源管道里——虽然我也一样，但你还是要解释清楚！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哦，这个我一会可以解释，但我现在非常需要一点帮助......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我觉得我在进来之前，应该是错估了这个管道的宽度。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "能不能拜托你帮帮忙......在后面推我一把？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌克西克",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好吧好吧......不把你推出去的话我也出不去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌克西克",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你也加把劲，嘿——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "呼......真是多谢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "没想到这个时候还有和我一样偷溜进来的人，你也是进来找人的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌克西克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4224_turdus_1",
      "text": "你也是？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "我的朋友前两天被抓走了，我打听到消息说他们可能在这里面，所以来看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "我叫罗莎琳，我的朋友都叫我烈夏。你呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌克西克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4224_turdus_1",
      "text": "乌克西克......这个蠢名字是我的朋友取的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "乌克西克，还挺好记的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "你的朋友也是联合大会的学生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌克西克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4224_turdus_1",
      "text": "联合大会？不，我没有听说过。我们有自己的名字，叫无缚者同盟！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "喔！很酷的名字——虽然我也没有听说过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "不过你钻能源管道也要来救的人，应该是很好的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌克西克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4224_turdus_1",
      "text": "他们......是很好的人，而且这里还是我的家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "......家？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "嘿！麻烦问一下，你们有在这里见到其他学生吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "从容的贵族学生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2187_1",
      "text": "哦，天哪，你们身上怎么这么脏。你们是刚从下水道里爬上来吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "唔，你倒也没说错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "从容的贵族学生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2187_1",
      "text": "好了，别再上前了，我们就这样说话吧。真要命......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "从容的贵族学生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2187_1",
      "text": "等等，你是自治团的......我差点把你认成那群自称无缚者同盟的流浪学生了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌克西克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4224_turdus_1",
      "text": "无缚者同盟......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "从容的贵族学生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2187_1",
      "text": "真是一群没有礼貌的人......领头的那个最是可恶，竟敢摆出一副领导者的派头，他的父母是什么爵位，这里哪轮得到他颐指气使？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌克西克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4224_turdus_1",
      "text": "你见到安托沙了？他们现在在哪里？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "从容的贵族学生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2187_1",
      "text": "从这里往东走，差不多是在那片脏兮兮的厂房后面。你们走过去应该就能看见他们了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "从容的贵族学生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2187_1",
      "text": "赶快过去吧，不用客气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "忧愁的学生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2178_1",
      "text": "瑙姆......我们要不还是回去吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "忧愁的学生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2178_1",
      "text": "我们还不知道这里是什么情况，那些打手看上去也不好惹......而且我听说，已经有学生失踪了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑙姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2187_1",
      "text": "够了，“铅笔头”。你愿意和那些下人为伍的话，你就自己回去好了。对我来说，听到他们粗鄙不堪的话语的每一秒都是折磨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌克西克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4224_turdus_1",
      "text": "嘿！你凭什么这么说他们？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "现在是怎么回事，是谁把你们关了起来？这片工厂到底是什么状况？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“铅笔头”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2178_1",
      "text": "我们也没搞清楚，前天晚上我们在舞会厅外面被警察抓了起来，不知道为什么被带到了这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“铅笔头”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2178_1",
      "text": "这里没有警察，我们偶尔能见到一些像混混的人在四处巡逻。我好像听到他们说，这片工业区的负责人叫巴普洛维奇......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑙姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2187_1",
      "text": "我记住这个名字了，等我出去以后，一定会好好找他算账。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑙姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2187_1",
      "text": "我们被关在这里一定是有人弄错了，虽然我不清楚到底为什么会产生这种误会，但我可不打算轻易接受他的道歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“铅笔头”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2178_1",
      "text": "对了，你们是从外面溜进来的吗？这里难道有连通外面的路？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌克西克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4224_turdus_1",
      "text": "从这里的能源管道的确可以出去，但我不确定能不能装得下你们这样的大块头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“铅笔头”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2178_1",
      "text": "我们或许，呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑙姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2187_1",
      "text": "什么？你难道打算从这个只能留给鼷兽通行的管道爬出去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑙姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2187_1",
      "text": "我可以向你保证，用不了多久就会有人接我们出去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌克西克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4224_turdus_1",
      "text": "嘘——有人来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性暴徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2166_1",
      "text": "我发誓这里刚刚绝对有东西过去了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性暴徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2167_1",
      "text": "你发誓？哈哈，*乌萨斯街头粗口*！你下次还不如直接放个屁——我是说，那样起码还能听个响。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性暴徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2167_1",
      "text": "又害我白跑一趟！这个鬼天气，连牙兽都知道找个干爽的土坡刨坑，我们还得替那位老爷守着破城墙上的破洞口！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性暴徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2167_1",
      "text": "喂，你还有酒吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性暴徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2166_1",
      "text": "*乌萨斯粗口*，别喝了！再守一天，之后就会有人来把洞填上了。瞪我干什么？信不信我用酒瓶子砸烂你的脑袋？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性暴徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2167_1",
      "text": "你是想比一比谁的头盖骨更硬吗？来啊，朝这儿打。打不死我，我就打死你！打死你，再剥了你的皮去跟格罗莫夫换酒喝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性暴徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2166_1",
      "text": "（呲牙咧嘴）好啊，那就打一场啊！*乌萨斯粗口*，我可太爱你这副疯模样了。我说，你想尝尝我用血酿的酒吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性暴徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2167_1",
      "text": "人血？人血也能酿酒吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性暴徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2166_1",
      "text": "牙兽的血——你觉得呢？难道是我的血，嗯？我还没像你一样疯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性暴徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2167_1",
      "text": "我说......我们还要拖着这个累赘走多久？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性暴徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2166_1",
      "text": "不知道，至少找个没人的地方藏起来吧。巴普洛维奇不让我们做这种事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性暴徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2167_1",
      "text": "真是受不了，我们居然要听那个傻子的话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性暴徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2166_1",
      "text": "有什么办法，出钱的是老大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性暴徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2167_1",
      "text": "我累了，这些学生天天都吃些什么，怎么会这么胖？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性暴徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2167_1",
      "text": "啊，我有一个点子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性暴徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2167_1",
      "text": "你看，这里有一个洞，我们有一个包裹，只要把这个包裹塞进这个破洞里——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性暴徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2166_1",
      "text": "我们就可以省下工夫去喝酒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性暴徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2166_1",
      "text": "你真是个该死的天才！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性暴徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2166_1",
      "text": "走吧，我带你去找我藏起来的酒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性暴徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2167_1",
      "text": "哦......真贴心，让我抱抱你，来嘛，来个温暖的抱抱......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“铅笔头”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2178_1",
      "text": "他们......在干什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“铅笔头”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2178_1",
      "text": "那个麻袋里......装的是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "几人躲在一旁，眼看着暴徒将一个鼓鼓囊囊的麻袋塞进管道里。\n麻袋末端有些卡顿，女人不满地拉开麻袋，露出沾满尘土的黑色裤腿与皮鞋——熟悉的学校制服，她试着将那条腿往麻袋的更深处塞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑙姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2187_1",
      "text": "啊......啊——！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "（小声）闭嘴！别出声！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性暴徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2166_1",
      "text": "我告诉过你，我刚才真的看到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性暴徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2167_1",
      "text": "好好，就数你最聪明了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性暴徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2166_1",
      "text": "巴普洛维奇说，不能杀人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性暴徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2167_1",
      "text": "他说的是贵族，笨蛋......何况有几百号人呢，少几个他也发现不了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑙姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2187_1",
      "text": "你们......打算......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑙姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2187_1",
      "text": "......你们......不可以......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "嘿，我来拦住他们，你们先走——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌克西克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4224_turdus_1",
      "text": "看看他们手里的家伙，别逞能了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌克西克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4224_turdus_1",
      "text": "跑——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌克西克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4224_turdus_1",
      "text": "看到了吗，他们有好多人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌克西克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4224_turdus_1",
      "text": "刚才要是动起手来我们就要吃大亏了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "就是这些人在管着这块地盘？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "他们到底是什么人？既然不是警察，为什么会有人带着军用武器？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌克西克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4224_turdus_1",
      "text": "不知道，反正在这里，他们和乌萨斯的警察没什么两样......都是一群欺负人的家伙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌克西克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4224_turdus_1",
      "text": "喂，你不是说安托沙他们就在这里吗，我怎么没有看到？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑙姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2187_1",
      "text": "我......我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌克西克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4224_turdus_1",
      "text": "这个人看上去已经吓傻了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌克西克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4224_turdus_1",
      "text": "嘿，烈夏，我们得想办法从这个街口绕过去，你看到那两个人了吗——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2166_1",
      "text": "7号街区净空。可以出来打扫了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌克西克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4224_turdus_1",
      "text": "安托沙！找到你了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "text": "乌克西克......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "text": "你为什么在这里，我以为你那天晚上逃掉了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌克西克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4224_turdus_1",
      "text": "太好了你还活着！我听说有人看到你被打死了又有人说你们被关了起来，我也不知道该怎么办了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌克西克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4224_turdus_1",
      "text": "马特维在哪里，其他人在哪里，你们都还好吗，你到底有没有在听我说话？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "text": "好，都很好。你再大点声把那些混蛋全都招过来，那就更好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌克西克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4224_turdus_1",
      "text": "你还要讽刺我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "text": "我们都还好，马特维，尤拉......大家都在这。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特维",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2160_1",
      "text": "乌克西克！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌克西克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4224_turdus_1",
      "text": "呜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "text": "总之......乌克西克，我很高兴你没事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑙姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2187_1",
      "text": "你们......你们杀人了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑙姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2187_1",
      "text": "你们也是杀人不眨眼的野蛮人......杀人犯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特维",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2160_1",
      "text": "你要去哪里？快回来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "text": "不要管他......这是哪儿来的傻子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌克西克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4224_turdus_1",
      "text": "刚才在那边捡到的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "text": "这里不是收容所，我们现在没有工夫理这种人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌克西克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4224_turdus_1",
      "text": "那只能把他们赶走咯？唔，如果他们被那些拿武器的混混杀了也无所谓？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特维",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2160_1",
      "text": "安托沙，小心点。就算你不在意他的死活，放任他到处乱跑，也容易招来那些暴徒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无缚者同盟成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2178_1",
      "text": "有人接近这里！安托沙，小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无缚者同盟成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2178_1",
      "text": "她手上的武器还沾着血，看上去很危险。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "text": "对面只有一个人？我去解决。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "等等，她不是敌人——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "冬将军！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "text": "我还以为那群混蛋已经把这一带的学生都抓起来了，还好，看上去你保护了不少人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "text": "所以，你叫安托沙？我叫索尼娅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "text": "你也是圣骏堡大学的学生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "text": "不完全算......不过我暂时和他们一起行动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "text": "我听说了，你们的人那天晚上包围了舞会厅，就是为了喊几句口号？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "text": "我承认，那不是一个聪明的主意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "text": "我对圣骏堡还不算熟悉......你们对现在的情况有多少了解？这里是什么地方？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "text": "这里叫卡托加区，曾经是供部分犯人劳动的工业地块，如今荒废许久，连能源供应也被切断了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "text": "我听说市政厅本来打算把这里彻底废弃，扔在荒野上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "text": "可是现在这里有这么多人，我们也被关了进来......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "text": "如果我猜得没错，是因为你们那边学生的贵族身份吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "text": "警察厅不愿处理那些贵族学生，就把你们都送到了这里来......而卡托加区在名义上也确实是官方处理罪犯的场所之一。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "text": "呵，原来是这样，倒也不难懂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "text": "可问题在于，现在管理卡托加区的就是一群完完全全的疯子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "text": "他们拿着不知道从哪里搞来的武器，像是在以杀人为乐一样......目前他们好像还被约束着，但这样下去，谁也不知道还会发生什么事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "text": "也许，我们应该合作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "text": "你手下有多少人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "text": "不......他们不能算是我的手下，和我一起被困在这里的学生有两百人左右。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "text": "那些养尊处优的大贵族，恐怕人再多也派不上什么用处。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "text": "我可没有余力去保护你们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "冬将军才不需要你们保护！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "text": "至少现在我们的目的是一样的，如果你相信我刚才展现的实力，那么也可以相信，我们会一起打败那些混混，从这里出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "索尼娅沉默了许久，然后向前迈出一大步——几乎是在同时，安托沙也朝前走了一步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "安托沙率先伸出了手。\n索尼娅握住了那只手。两只手握在一起，上下微微摇晃，又立刻分开了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "text": "抱歉刚刚先动了手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "text": "没关系，拳头会说话，它告诉我你是个不错的家伙——你的拳头路数有点意思，在哪儿练的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "text": "混迹街头，总有机会练的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "text": "话说在前面，我们现在虽然算是合作关系，可也不代表我们就是同伙了，我们的营地需要分开，不过可以接济你们一些物资。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "text": "十分感谢！那就按照你说的来，我们会好好珍惜这些物资的。需要共同行动的时候，我们再一起商量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "text": "好。那么再见，索尼娅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "text": "别忘了带走你的同伴......虽然现在少了一位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“铅笔头”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2178_1",
      "text": "（瑟瑟发抖）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "text": "......多谢你们保护他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "再见，小乌啾，多谢你帮助我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌克西克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4224_turdus_1",
      "text": "不要那么叫我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌克西克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4224_turdus_1",
      "text": "唉，算了，你也小心吧......再见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "冬将军，你的脸色真吓人！你还好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "text": "我没事......大家都怎么样？没有受伤吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "唔，卓娅有一点擦伤，没有大碍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "text": "......那就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "text": "我实在没想到你居然敢冒险一个人进来......这是真理她们计划好的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "哪来得及等计划，我担心晚一步就帮不上你了，给她们留了封信就赶过来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "是我擅自行动了，冬将军，如果你生气——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "text": "不......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "text": "烈夏，谢谢你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "抱、抱太紧了！倒也不用这么热情......喂，索尼娅？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "你在......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "你在害怕吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "text": "瞎说什么呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "没关系，没关系呀！我这不是来了嘛！咱们俩一起，有什么事是解决不了的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "两只拳头打不过的，难道四只拳头还打不过吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "再说了，外面还有那么多人，那么多双拳头！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "text": "你说得对，烈夏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "text": "我再也不会害怕了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特维",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2160_1",
      "text": "“索尼娅”，我们没有听说过这个名字，她不是那个时候他们中的一员。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "text": "我知道的，我不会迁怒于她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "text": "......我只是想起老师了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特维",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2160_1",
      "text": "我也是，安托沙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特维",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2160_1",
      "text": "还记得你告诉过我，组建无缚者同盟的时候，第一个想起我的理由吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "text": "......你是原来的小组里少有的平民出身，经历过更多的苦难，懂得生产，更懂得如何在乌萨斯生存。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特维",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2160_1",
      "text": "是的，“生存”，活下来才能实现理想，我们要活着出去，对吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特维",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2160_1",
      "text": "现在大家需要你的指挥，你要振作起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌克西克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4224_turdus_1",
      "text": "尤拉，为什么安托沙的脸色这么差？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2184_1",
      "text": "刚才那个人，别着一枚学生联合大会的徽章......那是我们还在彼得拉设夫斯基小组时，大家一起设计出来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌克西克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4224_turdus_1",
      "text": "“彼得拉设夫斯基小组”？那是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2184_1",
      "text": "还没有人告诉过你？安托沙是彼得拉设夫斯基小组的第一任组长。可是老师遇害后，我们被其他学生举报，被赶出了学校。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2184_1",
      "text": "但有些人却凭着出身免受处罚，用着小组原来的名字，去做那些令人不齿的蠢事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2184_1",
      "text": "尤其是他们那个组长，奥尔佳！我们永远都不会原谅她！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "窃窃私语的贵族B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2172_1",
      "text": "这个彼得拉设夫斯基小组......当时有好几位公爵的子女都参与其中，许多人闹到陛下那里祈求宽宥呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "窃窃私语的贵族A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2171_1",
      "text": "等等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "窃窃私语的贵族A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2171_1",
      "text": "这个彼得拉设夫斯基又是谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "窃窃私语的贵族B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2172_1",
      "text": "圣骏堡大学的文学教授啊，也是个印小报批评陛下的叛徒，你怎么不知道他啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "窃窃私语的贵族A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2171_1",
      "text": "大学里的叛徒比他们发的论文都多，这我哪能记得过来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仲裁人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2168_1",
      "text": "肃静！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仲裁委员会成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2171_1",
      "text": "（小声）阁下，接下来是两位贵族证人，或许还需要一些时间准备......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仲裁人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2168_1",
      "text": "......明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仲裁人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2168_1",
      "text": "诸位大人，虽然有些信息已经公开，但本庭会再详述一遍索尼娅在卡托加区内的“事迹”......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
